Correction on sentinel floor:
The commit message states "Scores at or below the -1e30 sentinel and NaNs are strictly excluded ... matching reference scan behavior."
Historically, the pre-970f5e19 CUDA scan in ds4_indexer_select floored at -__int_as_float(0x7f800000) = -inf, whereas Metal floored at -1e30 (selectIndexerSentinel in metal_ops_darwin.go). Commit 970f5e19 deliberately aligned CUDA with Metal's -1e30 sentinel, rather than preserving the legacy -inf floor.
